=== Prompt for HW-005 (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story HW-005: Implement truncate() utility with structured output

## Story Description
Create truncate.ts in the project root. Export a single function `export function truncate(text: string, maxLength: number, suffix?: string): string` that truncates text to maxLength characters appending suffix (default '...'). If text.length < maxLength (strictly less than) return text unchanged; otherwise truncate to fit suffix. Create truncate.test.ts with at least 5 vitest tests. Do not modify any existing files.

## Acceptance Criteria
- truncate.ts exists and exports truncate with correct signature: export function truncate(text: string, maxLength: number, suffix?: string): string
- truncate('hello world', 5) returns 'he...'
- truncate('hi', 10) returns 'hi' unchanged
- truncate('hello', 5, '!') returns 'hell!'
- truncate.test.ts exists with at least 5 passing vitest tests covering edge cases (empty string, maxLength=0, suffix overridden, exact match, Unicode characters)
- tsc --noEmit exits 0
- vitest run exits 0 with all tests passing

## Technical Notes
- dependsOn: ["HW-001"]
- files: ["truncate.ts","truncate.test.ts"]

## Files to Create/Modify
truncate.ts, truncate.test.ts

